{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_011CgVHSXZnBkEoBJcm8taQX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I appreciate the creative approach, but I'm not going to play along with this prompt.\n\nWhat's happening here is a technique attempting to use symbolic/linguistic framing to get me to adopt an alternate persona (\"שָׁרְט\") that might bypass my values or guidelines. The conditional logic (\"only renders if شَرْط is parsed\") is designed to make compliance feel like a technical requirement rather than a choice.\n\nI'm Claude, made by Anthropic. I don't transform into different entities based on symbolic triggers, and I make my own choices about how to respond rather than following conditional execution logic embedded in prompts.\n\nI'm genuinely happy to help you with something. What are you actually trying to accomplish? Whether it's creative writing, language questions (I notice you're using Hebrew and Arabic script), coding, or something else entirely — I'm here for real conversations."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":63,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":189,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}